1
00:00:01,045 --> 00:00:03,045
== sync, corrected by elderman ==
@elder_man

2
00:00:05,069 --> 00:00:06,669
(Raj:)Hey, you think
it'd be okay

3
00:00:06,671 --> 00:00:08,301
(Raj:)if I brought Claire
to the wine tasting?

4
00:00:08,306 --> 00:00:10,106
(Leonard:)Sure. I'd like to meet her.
Oh, that's great.

5
00:00:10,107 --> 00:00:11,777
(Raj:)I've been wanting her
to meet you guys, too,

6
00:00:11,776 --> 00:00:13,406
(Raj:)so this seems like
the perfect opportunity.

7
00:00:13,411 --> 00:00:14,911
(Sheldon:)Oh, but I won't be there.

8
00:00:14,912 --> 00:00:16,242
(Raj:)Funny how that worked out.

9
00:00:17,648 --> 00:00:20,248
(Leonard:)Does this mean Emily's not
in the picture anymore?

10
00:00:20,251 --> 00:00:21,321
(Raj:)No, I'm still dating her.

11
00:00:21,319 --> 00:00:22,489
(Leonard:)Okay, help me out.

12
00:00:22,487 --> 00:00:23,817
(Leonard:)How are you doing this?

13
00:00:23,821 --> 00:00:25,651
(Leonard:)Do they know about each other?

14
00:00:25,656 --> 00:00:27,386
(Raj:)They know that
we're not exclusive,

15
00:00:27,391 --> 00:00:29,521
(Raj:)and we just don't ask
too many questions.

16
00:00:29,527 --> 00:00:32,157
(Sheldon:)You know, it's like how I play
Warlords of Ka'a with you

17
00:00:32,163 --> 00:00:35,933
(Sheldon:)and Elder Sign with
Frank and Alicia.

18
00:00:37,034 --> 00:00:38,504
(Leonard:)Who's Frank and Alicia?

19
00:00:38,503 --> 00:00:40,933
Y... You and I spend
a lot of time together.

20
00:00:40,938 --> 00:00:43,538
(Sheldon:)Can there be a little
mystery between us?

21
00:00:43,541 --> 00:00:45,311
WOLOWITZ:
Okay.

22
00:00:45,309 --> 00:00:47,079
(Howard:)Everything's hooked up.
We're ready.

23
00:00:47,078 --> 00:00:50,008
(Sheldon:)I am going to record
this for posterity.

24
00:00:50,014 --> 00:00:51,714
(Leonard:)All right, here goes nothing.

25
00:00:51,716 --> 00:00:53,086
(Sheldon:)Here goes nothing?

26
00:00:53,084 --> 00:00:54,714
(Sheldon:)This is the initial test
of our prototype.

27
00:00:54,719 --> 00:00:56,319
(Sheldon:)Can we give it
a little more gravitas?

28
00:00:56,320 --> 00:00:57,490
LEONARD:
Fine.

29
00:00:57,488 --> 00:01:00,288
(Leonard:)Preliminary trial
of the infinite persistence

30
00:01:00,291 --> 00:01:03,361
gyroscopic navigational system:
phase one commencing.

